s8::thetaaplem3 |- { n e. ( 1 ... ( |_ ` Y ) ) | ( n e. Prime /\ ( n mod Q ) = ( A mod Q ) ) } C_ ( ( 1 ... ( |_ ` Y ) ) i^i Prime )
